    43	
    44	- `src/tui/gateway-chat.ts:287` —— `{ sessionKey, agentId?, limit }`
    45	- `src/agents/run-wait.ts:337-339` —— `{ sessionKey, limit: 50 }`，返回 `{ messages: Array<unknown> }`
