.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-28-
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-29-## Artifact Health Values
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-30-
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-31-- `valid`: evidence exists, is fresh enough, and can be cited.
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-32-- `stale`: evidence exists but violates freshness or drift rules.
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-33-- `missing`: evidence path or source is absent.
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-34-- `inconclusive`: evidence exists but cannot support acceptance.
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-35-- `blocked`: evidence requires human access or external setup.
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-36-
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-37-## Claim Support Values
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-38-
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-39-- `supports`: supports the claim being tested.
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-40-- `refutes`: refutes the claim being tested.
.harnessloop/state/evidence-index.md-41-- `partial`: supports only part of the claim.

